      "heading": "The tests that go in the record",
      "html": "<p>Per string: open-circuit voltage and short-circuit or operating current. Then DC insulation resistance, earthing and bonding, polarity and the AC checks. Check the inverter grid code region, isolators and labels.</p><p>Quickler asks for each as you work and attaches photos of the array, isolators, inverter display and labels at the point of test. The office sees the status without chasing.</p>"
    },
